                                "sense_id": "0c3e76ca-d91a-3f7f-b70c-a46c9b27ba44",
                                "text": "‘I wish I could have made him a gun-boy. There's no fun in shikarring alone, and this fellow would have been a perfect shikarri. I wonder what in the world he is.’"
